{"id":"method-quadratic-extremum","html":"<section class=\"contract\" id=\"contract\"><h2>什么时候用</h2><dl><dt>适合什么题</dt><dd>目标经整理、消元或换元可写成二次函数，要求最大值或最小值。</dd><dt>最后要得到什么</dt><dd>目标的最值与取到最值的变量值；若边界取不到，说明只有上界或下界。</dd><dt>要注意</dt><dd>二次项系数不为零；函数的自变量范围必须由原题条件确定，顶点或端点不在范围内时不能当作可取的最值点。</dd></dl></section><section id=\"path\"><h2>解题步骤</h2><p class=\"muted\">按顺序做。标了条件的技能，只在题目符合那个条件时才用。</p><ol class=\"method-path\" aria-label=\"解题步骤\"><li id=\"prepare\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><h3>按需整理、消元或换元</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#prepare\" aria-label=\"定位到按需整理、消元或换元\">#</a></div><p>利用已知关系把目标化成一个变量的表达式，保留分母非零等限制。</p><div class=\"step-calls\"><p class=\"rel-label\">看题目情况选用</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge-next/method-elimination/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>消元</a><small>需要利用等式消去一个变量时</small></li><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge-next/method-substitution/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>换元</a><small>需要把反复出现的整体设为新变量时</small></li><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge-next/skill-simplify/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>代数式化简</a><small>需要展开和合并同类项时</small></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"domain\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><h3>确定函数和变量范围</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#domain\" aria-label=\"定位到确定函数和变量范围\">#</a></div><p>写清二次函数的系数及自变量的完整范围；约束中的排除点也要保留。</p></li><li id=\"extremum\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><h3>比较顶点与区间求最值</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#extremum\" aria-label=\"定位到比较顶点与区间求最值\">#</a></div><p>根据开口方向、顶点位置和区间端点，求最大值或最小值，并判断能否取到。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge-next/quadratic-interval-extremum/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>求二次函数在区间上的最值与值域</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"verify\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><h3>回代验证原条件</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#verify\" aria-label=\"定位到回代验证原条件\">#</a></div><p>还原被消去或替换的变量，把候选值代入原题全部条件，写出最终最值及取值。</p></li></ol></section><section id=\"basis\"><h2>背后用到的知识</h2><p class=\"muted\">上面各步骤用到的性质和公式。做一道具体的题，通常只用到其中一部分。</p><div class=\"chips\"><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge-next/equality-properties/#addition\">等式的性质 · 同加同减</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge-next/equality-properties/#identity\">等式的性质 · 等值替换与定义域</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge-next/equality-properties/#multiplication\">等式的性质 · 同乘与非零同除</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge-next/function-range-extrema/#attainability\">函数的值域与最值 · 边界可达性</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge-next/quadratic-function-properties/#interval\">二次函数 · 区间上的值域</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge-next/quadratic-function-properties/#vertex\">二次函数 · 开口、对称轴与顶点</a></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>例题</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 定和求积的顶点路线</h3><p class=\"problem\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m,n&gt;0,m+n=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span>，求 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mn</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mn</span></span></span></span> 的最大值。</p><ol><li>消去 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> 得 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=m(2-m)=-m^2+2m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;m&lt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span>。</li><li>开口向下，顶点横坐标 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 在区间内，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>。</li><li>回代得 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=1&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>，满足原条件，所以最大值为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>。</li></ol><p class=\"source\">基本不等式专题 Q01 顶点分支 · <a href=\"/1/q01/?knowledge=next\">打开原题 · 关联预览</a></p></article></section>"}
